cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its teaching materials, please cite it as below."
title: "三视图到三维 / Multiview-to-3D Lab: a measured comparison of AI routes from three orthographic views to a 3D model"
abstract: "A teaching demo and small benchmark (16 synthetic objects with ground truth) comparing five routes from front/side/top views to 3D: silhouette carving (visual hull), an LLM writing Blender code in a render-and-compare loop, native multi-view-to-3D diffusion models via ComfyUI, turntable video to VGGT reconstruction, and image-model-generated three-view sheets. Includes an in-browser auto-playing demo with rotating 3D results. Part of the AI Teaching Demos series."
type: software
